{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0081_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_intro_1000_102mis", "source_sha256": "b2b3f83c4979e19ef4086857e61c77140ac9478357e03cfecd914ea68932acb7", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}さん！\nようこそ、いらっしゃいませ～！", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生！\n欢迎莅临～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0081_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_intro_1001_p", "source_sha256": "1ed0c242697e376f245c0b8c482d9683c6f56aa2219dc619cb940de9d81eb741", "ja": "青羽さん？　丁寧な出迎え、ありがとうございます。\nただいま戻りました。", "zh": "青羽小姐？谢谢你这么有礼地迎接我，\n我回来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0081_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_intro_1002_102mis", "source_sha256": "8f206a5a1f373fc90626f80a57d7dab4e119bfefc6edb0fcbd427d02bd21f799", "ja": "あっ！？　ごめんなさい、今のはちょっとした\n間違いで……！　あの、おかえりなさい！", "zh": "啊！？对不起，刚才是我\n不小心搞错了……！那个，欢迎回来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0081_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_intro_1003_102mis", "source_sha256": "47f2504efd3c2d712e3ffdbc5133bbd9eb1d365414a6a8ca08be6b96607095d7", "ja": "{$P$}さん、\n今日はいよいよ、関係者試写会ですね！", "zh": "{$P$}先生，\n今天就是媒体试映会了呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0081_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_intro_1004_p", "source_sha256": "adc8793b77cf6ce9a066e7e67e0c4d3a86be927d4da4b17599eac7b597ffe5f0", "ja": "ええ。そろそろお客さんも来る頃ですし、\n青羽さん、エントランスの方をお願いできますか？", "zh": "是啊，我想贵宾们也差不多快到了。\n青羽小姐，可以麻烦你去大厅接待吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0081_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_intro_1005_102mis", "source_sha256": "211325bcb4180b98975c727bb8d9219f71e7ca2dcad4e9a66b136fa40ebbef0d", "ja": "はい、もちろんです！　今日って、\n社長さんと音無先輩も来てくれるんですよね？", "zh": "好，当然没问题！听说今天，\n社长和音无前辈也会来吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0081_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_intro_1006_p", "source_sha256": "169afa565f055927e6932c78cc6be71199c4e5e93d6203122495a970bcf6c23a", "ja": "ええ。なので、事務所まで迎えに行ってこようかと。\n青羽さん、留守番をお願いできますか？", "zh": "是啊，所以我正打算去事务所接他们。\n青羽小姐，这里可以交给你顾吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0081_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_intro_1007_102mis", "source_sha256": "27022636be40388df718292fec43aadd50e16b21e14bb92f825867f8863f1e45", "ja": "はーい、いってらっしゃーい！\nえへへ、楽しみだなあ……♪", "zh": "好的～！请慢走～！\n嘿嘿，真是期待……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0081_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_intro_1008_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0081_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_intro_1009_president", "source_sha256": "634bfcedd14ffe44de4e84b3aff9b799e73d3974a8fd58886dd6da9ec3dc8416", "ja": "音無君、音無君！　どうかね？\n私のネクタイ、曲がっていないかね？", "zh": "音无、音无！你看看，\n我的领带有没有歪掉？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0081_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_intro_1010_101kot", "source_sha256": "a3d8e987e8fd5fc7a0be590b5d9b75ca20b095d1322b029073b5bbbb796e3a3e", "ja": "うーん？　ちょっと見づらいですけど……。\n多分大丈夫だと思いますよ、社長！", "zh": "嗯……有点难分辨……\n但我觉得应该没问题，社长！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0081_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_intro_1011_president", "source_sha256": "4b82c752f984d11f0fcfb5ecf4f926d5aa6834bcabb2709fe4215351ae12cbb6", "ja": "そ、そうかね？　今日はやはり、\n白いスーツにしておけばよかったかな。", "zh": "是、是吗？\n我今天是不是该穿白西装才对呀……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0081_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_intro_1012_101kot", "source_sha256": "4ffacba1deabc6b9819982e631a2288c81863023614d210331d794482ca65941", "ja": "社長、白いスーツなんて大胆ですね！\nそれなら私も、ドレスの方がよかったかしら……？", "zh": "社长，白西装也太大胆了吧！\n那样的话，我好像也该换上洋装……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0081_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_intro_1013_p", "source_sha256": "bc394e636a3ce4544ba871efdb08116e23f6f790eb0542f3ffa1cc4e96387cc2", "ja": "社長、音無さん。\nお疲れさまです。", "zh": "社长、音无小姐，\n两位辛苦了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0081_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_intro_1014_president", "source_sha256": "06dc944bec0f2b0133400e7df170e1b2944501c8f70f99eee888d48dde6ef6c6", "ja": "おお！　君、よく来てくれたね！\n私も音無君も、首を長～くして待っていたよ。", "zh": "喔喔，你来啦！\n我和音无一～直在等你呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0081_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_intro_1015_101kot", "source_sha256": "b6c69ab005b45623554bddec729f9e9bfa5391ebb9e069445ab1bef67b924d27", "ja": "おはようございます、{$P$}さん。\n今日はお招き、ありがとうございます！　うふふ♪", "zh": "早安，{$P$}先生。\n今天非常感谢你的邀请！呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0081_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_intro_1016_p", "source_sha256": "659c3d3b89052320958ee3a6cc2b78d90f066208252058ce2fa766fbcf4535cb", "ja": "いえ、こちらこそ！　今回の試写会が開けたのも、\n社長や音無さんのおかげですから。", "zh": "哪里，别这么说！这次能举办试映会，\n也都是托社长还有音无小姐的福。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0081_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_intro_1017_president", "source_sha256": "5ec2a05a3c3ccb89ed8384d7589c224307304efb5d28d950a1918d77fa925edc", "ja": "いやいや！　もちろん我々の力もあるとは思うが……\nやはり今回の作品、君なしでは作れなかったよ。", "zh": "谦虚什么呢！我们是有出力没错……\n但这次的作品，你才是最大功臣啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0081_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_intro_1018_president", "source_sha256": "958b19bcf85c873b4756ff511275462de29fb2f0862c5e2e282efb4d0415e755", "ja": "私など、楽しみ過ぎて、\n朝から仕事が手につかなかったほどだよ。", "zh": "我自己都期待得不得了，\n从一早开始就无法专心工作呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0081_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_intro_1019_101kot", "source_sha256": "93f0981875d013c8298351054d98686c8116a9476b7cfd342e59032032891be5", "ja": "本当に。社長ったら上の空で、おせんべいと\n間違えて、CDをかじりそうになってたんですよ？", "zh": "就是啊，真受不了社长，成天心不在焉的。\n差点把CD当成仙贝咬下去呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0081_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_intro_1020_president", "source_sha256": "f19f87fd44b8a633f35322589c72196797839d4520a8b0524e41c723f82ede4b", "ja": "いやはや、失敬。しかしそう言う音無君だって、\nずっとソワソワしていたじゃないか。", "zh": "哎呀呀，失礼了。但音无你自己不也是\n整天都静不下来吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0081_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_intro_1021_p", "source_sha256": "e36aec2b3b2775cd4978a6d677d12479b41af62124e43c62df5d8970357c989c", "ja": "お二人とも、そんなに楽しみに……。\nありがとうございます！", "zh": "原来两位都这么期待……\n真是太感谢了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0081_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_intro_1022_president", "source_sha256": "bc76a40e1da425346756ccfa13cba3e1848c35aa72a887c49ed34b2554720369", "ja": "もちろんだとも！　何しろ今回の作品には、我が\n765プロのアイドルが大勢出演しているんだからね。", "zh": "那当然啊！毕竟这次的作品，\n我们765艺能旗下可是有许多偶像参与拍摄呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0081_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_intro_1023_101kot", "source_sha256": "640bd5706e97c4e98d515fd735348e5b7e7d0b60d32cfac697007917122bd912", "ja": "アイドルのみんなが演じるヒーロー……\nとっても楽しみですね！", "zh": "偶像们所饰演的英雄……\n真是令人期待！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0081_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_intro_1024_president", "source_sha256": "3ee9932b29ea2e7cfff68923e2bebf601382a4189b0a97056ccd1c10a3041431", "ja": "アイドル諸君が、どんな熱演を見せてくれるのか……。\n私も、大いに期待しているよ！", "zh": "究竟诸位偶像会让我们看到什么样的精采演技呢……\n对此我也是满心期待啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0081_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_intro_1025_p", "source_sha256": "c8437da922b05a66a006272ae646cc70f57e96453c9e5b620e3abbd8e90368f7", "ja": "はい！", "zh": "是！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0081_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_intro_1026_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0081_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_intro_1027_syoutaikyakutati", "source_sha256": "9bebaba67157bec01532b60c97e895107832991224b3632a07e9fedb567b1db0", "ja": "ザワザワ……ザワザワ……。", "zh": "（吵杂……吵杂……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0081_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_intro_1028_p", "source_sha256": "238f4d53026723d6085d9b4f847ee1b2b8fa68e8deede9595cbf32312f78289a", "ja": "（プレス関係や取引先の人達で、劇場の観客席は満員。\n目の肥えた人達ばかりだが、楽しんでもらえるはずだ）", "zh": "（剧场观众席坐满了媒体以及合作的客户们。\n虽然他们眼光都不低，但我相信今天会让他们满意。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0081_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_intro_1029_101kot", "source_sha256": "96135631342b2d2e20da705ebe6e86f73af757febfdbf102e4b50749d7f0b4f3", "ja": "社長、社長！\nスマートフォンの電源は、切らなきゃダメですよ！", "zh": "社长、社长！\n手机要关机才行啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0081_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_intro_1030_president", "source_sha256": "17be7e655a73a10142e3c29304ddf8483a7b1db67d58a2093d7ac787e35a893a", "ja": "おっと、そうだった！　はっはっは。\n流石、慣れたものだね、音無君。", "zh": "哎呀，对喔！哈哈哈，\n不愧是音无，很习惯这种场合呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0081_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_intro_1031_102mis", "source_sha256": "322f7c0dc03edce8ab9ef8e30263d8a5ce5c0761720ffb434f7af3e1caaa3dbb", "ja": "それでは……お集まりのみなさま、\n大変長らくお待たせいたしました！", "zh": "那么……现场的各位贵宾，\n不好意思，让大家久等了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0081_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_intro_1032_102mis", "source_sha256": "83de57b2f9528d01e9bd055c62d1136d09d067c0bbd0be31cd9ad58c3becf095", "ja": "『アイドルヒーローズ　ジェネシス』、\nどうぞ、お楽しみくださいっ！", "zh": "接下来就请大家好好欣赏\n《偶像英雄联盟Genesis》！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0081_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_intro_1033_se", "source_sha256": "380e59b3e7525b88b1c97d8fc3f5205d52aa0dffb3e9fb67ccd35ebf16867fe1", "ja": "パチパチパチ、パチパチパチ……！", "zh": "（掌声响起）……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
